000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.    TRLBTSEL.
000400 AUTHOR.        KURT MOVSESIAN/JIM COFFMAN (MAINTAINER).
000600
000700**************************************************************
000800*                                                            *
000900*   T R L B T S E L   THIS PROGRAM LAUNCHES THE JOB THAT     *
001000*     PROCESSES THE BATCH SHIPPING RELEASE FILE (DSHIPREL).  *
001100*     THIS PROGRAM GIVES THE USER 3 OPTIONS BY WHICH TO      *
001200*     PROCESS THE BATCH FILE.  BASED ON THE SELECTION IT     *
001300*     BUILDS THE JOB STREAM (BXRLCRTE) TO DENOTE THE         *
001400*     SELECTION MADE.  THIS PROGRAM CAN ALSO BE USED TO      *
001500*     BROWSE THE BATCH FILE WITHOUT LAUNCHING THE JOB        *
001600*     STREAM "BXRLCRTE"                                      *
001700*                                                            *
001800**************************************************************
001900*                                                            *
002000*   TO BUILD THE TEMPORARY JOB STREAM "BXRLCRTE" THIS        *
002100*   PROGRAM USES 2 PERMANENT PARTIAL JOB STREAMS.            *
002200*     1) BXRLTOP     - USED TO FORM THE TOP OF THE JOB       *
002300*        'BXRLCRTE'     PRIOR TO THE USER CHOSEN SELECTIONS  *
002400*     2) BXRLBOT     - USED TO FORM THE BOTTON OF THE JOB    *
002500*        STREAM AFTER THE USER CHOSEN SELECTIONS HAVE BEEN   *
002600*        WRITE TO THE JOB STREAM 'BXRLCRTE'.                 *
002700*                                                            *
002800**************************************************************
      *C
      *C  SEPT 16, 1996     CA YODER
      *C    MODIFIED PROGRAM FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
      *C  SEPT 10, 1997     CA YODER
      *C    CHANGED THE WAY SHIPPING RELEASES ARE SELECTED FROM THE
      *C    BATCH FILE TO BE PROCESSED.  IN ADDITION TO BEING ABLE TO
      *C    KEY IN REQUIREMENT ORDERS TO INCLUDE, THE ABILITY TO MARK
      *C    REQUIREMENT ORDERS WITH AN "X" WAS ADDED.  THE ABILITY TO
      *C    SPECIFY EXCLUDED REQUIREMENT ORDERS WAS REMOVED.
      *C
      *C  10/27/1997        CA YODER
      *C    RE-COMPILED PROGRAM TO PICK UP NOTIFY USER-ID IN DSHIPREL.
      *C    ALSO INCREASED LENGTH OF BATCHFILE FROM 96 TO 106.
      *C
      *C   9/17/98   CA YODER
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO PROCESS NEW DESCRIPTION LINE "99"
      *C   WHICH CONTAINS ALL 12 STANDARD INSTRUCTIONS FROM THE
      *C   BLANKET ORDER.  THESE RECORDS WILL BE IGNORED WHEN
      *C   DISPLAYING SHIPPING RELEASES ON THE SELECTION SCREEN.
      *C
      *C   3/7/2001   CA YODER   (LAWTON REQUEST)
      *C   ADDED "EXCLUDE" OPTION BACK INTO LIST OF OPTIONS TO
      *C   SELECT REQUIREMENT ORDERS TO BE PROCESSED.
      *C
      *C   MAY 2001   JE COFFMAN
      *C   ADDED CHECK FOR JCW SET VIA CLPS2 OR CLPS2X TO TELL
      *C   US WHETHER THE USER IS PROCESSING NORMAL PS2 RELEASES
      *C   OR HELD PS2 RELEASES.
      *C
