005800     SELECT BATCH-FILE-SORTED ASSIGN TO DISK-BATCFILE.
      *        ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
005900*        ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
006000*        RELATIVE KEY IS ACT-KEY
      *        FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
