           OPEN I-O DISPLAY-FILE.
           OPEN INPUT MPLTINFO-I, DPORECD-I, DSHIPREL-I.

           MOVE "N"     TO  SAVE-PCPO-SW.
039500     MOVE "PCPO"  TO  PLT-ARG.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
039900         MOVE "READ FAILED IN TRLBTSEL" TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
040000         MOVE PLT-ARG                 TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
040100         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
           IF MPLTINFO-PCPO-SW = " "
               MOVE "N"                     TO  SAVE-PCPO-SW
           ELSE
040200     MOVE MPLTINFO-PCPO-SW            TO  SAVE-PCPO-SW.

038800**************************************************
038900*                                                *
039000*   GET CO. AND PRIME FROM MPLTINFO              *
039100*   USING 'P 01' AS THE ARGUMENT                 *
039200*                                                *
039300**************************************************
039400
039500     MOVE "P 01"  TO  PLT-ARG.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
039900         MOVE "DBGET MPLTINFO 1-HSK P 01"  TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
040000         MOVE PLT-ARG                 TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
040100         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
040200     MOVE MPLTINFO-COMPANY            TO  COMP-SCREEN-INDIC.
           ACCEPT CUR-DATE FROM DATE.
           ACCEPT MC-LOCAL-DATA-AREA FROM LOCAL-DATA-AREA.
040500
040600 1-H-X.
040700     EXIT.
040800
040900 2-EOJ.
           CLOSE DISPLAY-FILE, MPLTINFO-I, DPORECD-I, DSHIPREL-I.
