           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER  TO DE1-MESSAGE-LINE,
                                   DE2-MESSAGE-LINE,
                                   DE3-MESSAGE-LINE.
048900
049000 4-PGM-ERROR-X.
049100     EXIT.
